 # H66_POR HSVJ startup and packaging policy
+
+## Internal ROM updates (policy 23, v32 onward)
+
+Recovery is now built from source with the protected HSVJ internal installer.
+The immutable reference Recovery hash below remains a reference-input check;
+it is no longer the Recovery packaged in new images. The stable kernel, fixed
+partition table and protected hardware/huoshan partitions remain unchanged.
+The canonical build validates the new ramdisk entry, shared dependencies and
+ext4 mounts. Source and verification tools live in
+`D:/HVIDEO/Hplayer/system-integration/hsvj-rom-update`.
